satisfied|Meeting expectations is not absolute perfection. Bicycle repair and collection align in translation; with complement checked and no inference of completed action as a lexical grammar restriction.
wish|Unreal desire verb, countable desired outcome and goodwill message have separate source ordinals. Present unreal wish uses past came deliberately; Vietnamese keeps Sunday frequency and family companions.
choir|Organized singing group is not restricted to church. Quiet practice example retains concert timing and hall; collective noun does not imply every group member is a soloist or professionally employed.
hail|Praise, impersonal ice weather and calling a taxi reviewed separately with appropriate valency. Oxford verb evidence used despite conflicting noun evidence; noun hail is not silently claimed covered.
index|Numerical indicator and searchable book list distinguished. Definition avoids an unsupported market-only restriction; Vietnamese and grammar notes separate index from chapter contents without asserting universal placement.
